  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p> Your lower leg is left stripped of skin and flesh, the half-severed foot dangling limply. Shards of the long bones, the tibia and ulna, stick out from the gory mess. It’s obvious it’ll have to come off! Your foe looks insufferably pleased with itself!</p> <p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (3), @Condition[Bleeding] (2) and @Condition[Prone]. The leg is lost – Amputation (Challenging). If you don’t receive Surgery within a week for a proper amputation you’ll contract Blood Rot as the remains go gangrenous.</p>"
    },
